description_of_development:
To operate Food and Drink Services, Indoor Sales and Service, Office, and multi-unit Housing Residential, construct an addition, and exterior and interior alterations (Williams Hall):
Addition to 2nd floor - (pedway connection to parkade);
Addition to 8th/roof floor - Indoor amenity area; 
Lower Level 2 - Food and Drink Services and Bars;
Lower Level 1 - 5 Food and Drink Services and Bars;
Main floor - Office, Food and Drink Services, Indoor Sales and Service;
2nd floor - 6 multi-unit housing dwellings and common residential amenity area;
3rd - 7th floor - 84 multi-unit housing dwellings;
8th/roof floor - Indoor and Outdoor Residential Amenity Area;

To construct 3 mixed use Commercial buildings in Area A including:
CRU A - General Retail Store, Restaurant, Child Care Service (80 children);
CRU B - Restaurant with Drive-in Food Service, Health Services;
CRU C - Restaurant with Drive-in Food Service, Health Services.

Comprehensive Sign Design Plan (EVER SQUARE)
To construct 8 Multi-Use Commercial buildings with 407 vehicular parking stalls (126 underground parkade and 281 surface vehicular), to include:

Building A1 – A Restaurant, Health Services, General Retail Stores, Professional, Financial and Office Support Services and outdoor rooftop patio;
Building A2 - Restaurant with Drive-in Food Services; 
Building A3 - Restaurant with Drive-in Food Service with attached outdoor patio; 
Building B – Restaurants, Commercial School and General Retail Stores;
Building C - Restaurant with Drive-in Food Service with attached outdoor patio;
Building D1 - Rapid Drive Through Vehicle Service (oil change and preventative maintenance services) with 3 individual queuing spaces;
Building D2 - Rapid Drive Through Vehicle Service (car wash) with queuing aisle and 6 queuing spaces; 
Building D3 - Gas Bar (4 pump islands) with canopy and Convenience Retail Store. (Ever Square)

To construct 2 mixed use Commercial buildings in Area B (Co-Op) including:
CRU D - Gas Bar and Convenience Retail Store;
CRU E - Rapid Drive Through Vehicle Service (Car Wash)

To construct 8 Multi-Use Commercial buildings with 407 vehicular parking stalls (126 underground parkade and 281 surface vehicular), to include:

Building A1 – A Restaurant, Health Services, General Retail Stores, Professional, Financial and Office Support Services and outdoor rooftop patio;
Building A2 - Restaurant with Drive-in Food Services; 
Building A3 - Restaurant with Drive-in Food Service with attached outdoor patio; 
Building B – Restaurants, Commercial School and General Retail Stores;
Building C - Restaurant with Drive-in Food Service with attached outdoor patio;
Building D1 - Rapid Drive Through Vehicle Service (oil change and preventative maintenance services) with 3 individual queuing spaces;
Building D2 - Rapid Drive Through Vehicle Service (car wash) with queuing aisle and 6 queuing spaces; 
Building D3 - Gas Bar (4 pump islands) with canopy and Convenience Retail Store. (Ever Square)

To construct alterations to a Residential (Multi-unit Housing) development;
building 3 is reduced from 6 Storeys down to 4, and the number of Dwellings is reduced from 200 to 132;
building 4 is reduced from 12 Storeys down to 4, and the number of Dwellings is reduced from 133 to 35;  Convenience Retail Use will remain on a portion of the main floor of building 4.
